# Dustwallow Marsh - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans and formulas whose SOURCE is physically in
# Dustwallow Marsh, verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Four recipes are vendor-sold
# by the Alliance vendor Helenia Olden in Theramore; five more drop each from
# a single in-zone mob (two also drop in the Barrens, noted honestly). In-zone
# recipes sold only by Horde-faction vendors are excluded (Alterac precedent —
# see docs/dustwallow-companions-inventory.md), every other Dustwallow-dropping
# recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest records carry no reward
# data (see docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Engineering, First Aid,
# Fishing and Alchemy have no Dustwallow source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/dustwallow-recipes
title Dustwallow Marsh - Recipes & Patterns
levels 35-45
zone Dustwallow Marsh
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords dustwallow, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Theramore - Helenia's stock (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1445

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  tip Helenia Olden (66.44, 51.46) sells patterns in Theramore.
  buy 5789 "Pattern: Murloc Scale Bracers"
  note Also sold by Horde vendors elsewhere; the Alliance source is Helenia.

step Theramore - Helenia's stock (Cooking)

  zone map 1445

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Helenia Olden (66.44, 51.46) sells recipes in Theramore; the Roast Raptor and Dragonbreath Chili are also sold by Horde vendors elsewhere.
  buy 12228 "Recipe: Roast Raptor"
  buy 12233 "Recipe: Mystery Stew"
  buy 12239 "Recipe: Dragonbreath Chili"

step Mirefin shore - the Shortsword (Blacksmithing)

  zone map 1445

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  loop
  goto 53.96,15.18
  goto 54.19,15.66
  kill 4362 optional
  collect 251459 "Plans: Mithril Shortsword" optional
  note The Mirefin Coastrunner (level 36) on the north-west shore is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Mirefin shore - silk cuffs (Tailoring)

  zone map 1445

  when skill Tailoring 1

  loop
  goto 53.78,15.15
  goto 54.19,15.66
  kill 4359 optional
  collect 254020 "Pattern: Earthen Silk Cuffs" optional
  note The Mirefin Murloc (level 35) on the north-west shore is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Firemane - the headband (Tailoring)

  zone map 1445

  when skill Tailoring 1

  loop
  goto 48.16,76.29
  goto 48.54,73.17
  kill 4334 optional
  collect 254684 "Pattern: Stormcloth Headband" optional
  note The Firemane Flamecaller (level 43), far south, is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Firemane - the formula (Enchanting)

  zone map 1445

  when skill Enchanting 1

  loop
  goto 36.80,69.00
  goto 38.20,66.80
  goto 42.20,66.20
  goto 44.80,69.20
  goto 47.00,77.80
  goto 51.00,71.60
  kill 4329 optional
  collect 249511 "Formula: Enchant 2H Weapon - Lesser Agility" optional
  note The Firemane Scout (level 41), far south, is the sole dropper anywhere — but the same scout also drops it in the Barrens, so this is a dual-zone drop, not Dustwallow-exclusive. No quest takes it in the data.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Bloodfen - rouladen (Cooking)

  zone map 1445

  when skill Cooking 1

  loop
  goto 31.26,66.01
  goto 32.71,64.41
  goto 33.53,72.05
  goto 36.31,66.10
  goto 37.54,67.84
  kill 4357 optional
  collect 250184 "Recipe: Raptor Rouladen" optional
  note The Bloodfen Lashtail (level 40), far south, is the sole dropper anywhere — but the same lashtail also drops it in the Barrens, so this is a dual-zone drop, not Dustwallow-exclusive. No quest takes it in the data.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step No source here

  zone map 1445

  note Engineering, First Aid, Fishing and Alchemy have no Dustwallow Marsh recipe source in the data — that is stated, not padded. Trainer-taught staples live in Polestar's own profession guides.
